  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Reason for Refusal -\r\n\r\nThe proposed extension by reason of its size, bulk, location and design would harm the architectural integrity of the host building, disrupt the uniform terrace design that forms a core part of Lock House's character and set an undesirable precedent leading to wider fa�ade degradation. As a result, the proposal would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the host building and surrounding area contrary to Policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - Reason for Refusal - \r\n\r\nThe proposed development would generate a harmful impact to the adjacent neighbouring properties in terms of potential loss of light/overshadowing, sense of enclosure and reduced outlook. Therefore, the proposal would be unacceptable and fails to comply with policy A1 of the 2017 Camden Local Plan and the Amenity CPG"
